[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by her", "start": 6.96, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "excellency Silani Bhorton, President of", "start": 9.92, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "the Commonwealth of Dominica. I request", "start": 13.2, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "protocol to escort her excellency and", "start": 16.4, "duration": 7.879}, {"text": "invite her to address the assembly.", "start": 19.52, "duration": 4.759}, {"text": "Mr. President, excellencies,", "start": 36.64, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "distinguished delegates, Mabria, good", "start": 40.239, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "afternoon, I bring greetings to this", "start": 44.239, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "assembly from the people and government", "start": 46.96, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "of the Commonwealth of Dominica.", "start": 49.28, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "I congratulate you, Mr. President on", "start": 52.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "your election on the theme and on the", "start": 55.12, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "theme chosen for this 81st session of", "start": 57.92, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "the General Assembly.", "start": 60.96, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "Restoring trust, managing", "start": 63.76, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "transformation,", "start": 66.479, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "a united nations that delivers for all.", "start": 68.08, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "This theme speaks directly to the", "start": 73.6, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "defining challenges of our time.", "start": 76.159, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "We are living through an age of profound", "start": 79.759, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "transformation.", "start": 82.72, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Technology is changing how we work,", "start": 84.479, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "communicate, and understand the world.", "start": 87.52, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Climate change is reshaping economies,", "start": 91.6, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "communities, and entire ecosystems.", "start": 94.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Conflicts are destroying lives and", "start": 99.04, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "displacing families. Economic", "start": 101.36, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "uncertainty is deepening inequality", "start": 104.079, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "while progress towards achieving the", "start": 107.119, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "sustainable development goals has", "start": 109.439, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "stalled.", "start": 111.84, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "These challenges are not unfolding in", "start": 114.159, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "isolation.", "start": 116.96, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "They are interconnected", "start": 118.56, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "global in scale and beyond the capacity", "start": 120.799, "duration": 8.001}, {"text": "of any one nation to address alone.", "start": 124.079, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "They demand stronger cooperation and", "start": 128.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "renewed confidence in multilateralism.", "start": 131.2, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "Yet, excellencies,", "start": 135.44, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "at the very moment when collective", "start": 138.239, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "action is most urgently needed, this", "start": 140.4, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "organization stands at a crossroads.", "start": 144.319, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "The question before us, therefore, is", "start": 148.56, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "whether we possess the courage,", "start": 151.599, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "solidarity, and political will to shape", "start": 154.56, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "that change and guide our world towards", "start": 158.319, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "peace, justice, and shared prosperity.", "start": 162.0, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "I strongly believe that most", "start": 167.599, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "right-thinking individuals would agree", "start": 170.239, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "that the UN system has substantially", "start": 173.28, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "delivered for all countries over the", "start": 176.08, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "several decades of its existence.", "start": 179.519, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "For more than 80 years, this", "start": 182.959, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "organization has embodied humanity's", "start": 185.2, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "highest collective aspiration", "start": 188.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "that countries large and small, rich and", "start": 191.519, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "poor, can work together to prevent", "start": 195.36, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "conflict, protect human dignity, and", "start": 198.48, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "improve the lives of their people.", "start": 202.319, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "The United Nations provides shelter and", "start": 206.159, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "protection to people enduring conflict,", "start": 208.8, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "displacement, and natural disaster. It", "start": 212.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "supports education,", "start": 215.76, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "healthc care, peacekeeping, elections,", "start": 217.92, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "and development in communities that", "start": 221.76, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "might otherwise be forgotten.", "start": 224.56, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "These achievements matter and must never", "start": 227.92, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "be dismissed or diminished.", "start": 232.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "What the United Nation does not", "start": 234.879, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "currently do enough is deliver at the", "start": 237.84, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "transformative level.", "start": 241.84, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "Too often, humanity and the institutions", "start": 245.28, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "we have created to serve us have had to", "start": 248.879, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "concentrate on managing one crisis after", "start": 252.239, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "another without giving enough attention", "start": 256.32, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "to the conditions that allow them to", "start": 259.759, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "persist.", "start": 262.4, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Excellencies, there is no question that", "start": 264.639, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "managing crisis is necessary. It brings", "start": 268.24, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "relief, restores hope, and saves lives.", "start": 272.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "But we cannot stop there.", "start": 276.24, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Our responsibility", "start": 278.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "must also be to address the root causes", "start": 280.8, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "of these problems and build systems that", "start": 284.88, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "are fairer, stronger, and better able to", "start": 288.8, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "serve our people.", "start": 292.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "The true test of this organization,", "start": 295.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "therefore, is not only how well we", "start": 297.6, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "respond after people have suffered. It", "start": 301.12, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "is also whether we can work together to", "start": 304.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "prevent that suffering in the first", "start": 308.16, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "place.", "start": 310.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "This is not to dismiss what has already", "start": 312.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "been achieved. It is a call for us to", "start": 314.96, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "build on that progress, strengthen our", "start": 318.0, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "cooperation and deliver the meaningful", "start": 320.96, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "change that our people expect from us.", "start": 323.52, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "A fundamental question that one must ask", "start": 328.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "is", "start": 332.16, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "can the international system still", "start": 333.68, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "deliver?", "start": 336.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "For Dominica, this is not an abstract", "start": 339.199, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "question. When a hurricane destroys our", "start": 342.56, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "infrastructure, when international", "start": 345.84, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "energy prices rise, when access to", "start": 348.479, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "capital becomes more expensive, when", "start": 351.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "global markets change, or when climate", "start": 355.039, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "finance remains beyond our reach, the", "start": 358.24, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "consequences are felt immediately in our", "start": 361.6, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "homes, in our businesses, in our schools", "start": 365.199, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "and hospitals, and in the very lives of", "start": 368.639, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "our people.", "start": 371.919, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Yet, Mr. President, I do not come before", "start": 373.919, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "this assembly to speak only of", "start": 378.08, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "vulnerability.", "start": 380.479, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "I wish to speak of transformation and", "start": 382.319, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "resilience.", "start": 385.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Dominica has made a choice. We have", "start": 387.28, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "chosen not only to rebuild after", "start": 390.96, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "disaster,", "start": 393.52, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "but to build differently, build better,", "start": 395.039, "duration": 8.561}, {"text": "build stronger. We have chosen not only", "start": 399.84, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "to adapt to climate change but to", "start": 403.6, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "demonstrate what a climate resilient", "start": 406.72, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "economy and country can look like. And", "start": 409.759, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "we have chosen to move from dependence", "start": 414.08, "duration": 7.08}, {"text": "to greater resilience.", "start": 417.12, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 421.199, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "in 2017,", "start": 423.199, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "category 5 Hurricane Maria demonstrated", "start": 425.68, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "with devastating force the vulnerability", "start": 429.199, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "of small island states like Dominica.", "start": 433.199, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "The economic and human consequences were", "start": 436.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "enmous.", "start": 439.759, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "Hurricane Maria, however, also taught us", "start": 442.0, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "an important lesson.", "start": 446.24, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "Resilience should never begin after the", "start": 449.599, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "disaster.", "start": 453.039, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "Resilience must begin before disasters.", "start": 454.639, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "The international community must", "start": 460.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "therefore move from a model that", "start": 462.96, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "primarily finances reconstruction after", "start": 465.68, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "catastrophe to one that invests", "start": 469.199, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "systematically", "start": 472.16, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "in resilience before disaster strikes.", "start": 473.68, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "For Dominica, this means resilient roads", "start": 478.08, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "and bridges, resilient buildings,", "start": 481.759, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "reliable communications,", "start": 485.44, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "modern water systems, strengthened", "start": 487.84, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "health infrastructure", "start": 491.039, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "and disaster ready communities.", "start": 493.12, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "But resilience is not only physical.", "start": 497.36, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "A resilient country must have resilient", "start": 501.199, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "institutions.", "start": 504.16, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "It must have resilient public finances.", "start": 505.759, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "It must have resilient energy systems", "start": 509.599, "duration": 8.481}, {"text": "and must have resilient food systems.", "start": 513.279, "duration": 9.041}, {"text": "Above all, a resilient nation must have", "start": 518.08, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "people who possess the skills and", "start": 522.32, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "confidence to withstand shocks and move", "start": 525.44, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "forward.", "start": 529.68, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "That is the Dominica that we are", "start": 531.839, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "building.", "start": 534.64, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 536.56, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Dominica has begun the transition from", "start": 538.399, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "imported fossil fuels to renewable", "start": 540.88, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "energy.", "start": 544.0, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Our geothermal power plant is now in", "start": 545.519, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "commercial operation and increasing the", "start": 548.64, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "renewable share of our electricity", "start": 551.76, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "generation to approximately 84%.", "start": 554.16, "duration": 9.84}, {"text": "We are well on our way to achieving 100%", "start": 559.12, "duration": 10.2}, {"text": "renewable energy by 2030.", "start": 564.0, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "This is more than an energy project.", "start": 569.36, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "It is economic transformation.", "start": 573.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "It demonstrates that small states can", "start": 577.519, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "lead in the transition to clean energy.", "start": 580.48, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "Every barrel of oil that we no longer", "start": 585.12, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "need to import strengthens of our", "start": 587.76, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "strengthens our resilience to", "start": 591.279, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "international price shocks. Every unit", "start": 593.279, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "of clean electricity we produce", "start": 596.48, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "strengthens our energy security.", "start": 599.519, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "Affordable, reliable renewable energy", "start": 603.68, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "can become a foundation for new", "start": 607.839, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "industries,", "start": 610.32, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "new investment,", "start": 611.839, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "new employment, and greater", "start": 613.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "competitiveness.", "start": 616.64, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "The lesson is important beyond Dominica.", "start": 618.56, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "We need international finance that", "start": 623.44, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "recognizes the transformative nature of", "start": 626.56, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "renewable energy investment in", "start": 630.16, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "vulnerable countries.", "start": 633.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "We need financing mechanisms that allow", "start": 635.76, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "countries such as Dominica to move", "start": 639.2, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "faster.", "start": 642.56, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "And we need partnerships that allow the", "start": 644.16, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "energy transition to become an engine of", "start": 647.2, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "economic development and growth.", "start": 651.04, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "Our ambition is not merely to generate", "start": 655.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "clean electricity.", "start": 658.959, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Our ambition is to use clean energy to", "start": 661.44, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "transform our economy.", "start": 665.279, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "Mr. President, the international", "start": 668.88, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "community has become very good at", "start": 672.0, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "recognizing vulnerability.", "start": 675.279, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "We have become less successful at", "start": 678.32, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "financing the transformation that", "start": 681.6, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "vulnerability requires.", "start": 684.48, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "Too often the cycle is predictable.", "start": 687.92, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "A disaster occurs, infrastructure is", "start": 692.959, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "destroyed, and economic activity", "start": 696.399, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "collapses.", "start": 698.56, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "We then mobilize resources to rebuild", "start": 700.72, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "what was lost,", "start": 703.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "often through borrowing that", "start": 705.92, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "substantially increases debt to rebuild", "start": 708.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "what we could have made more resilient", "start": 711.76, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "from the outset. This is not an", "start": 714.56, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "efficient financial model.", "start": 717.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "The best time to build resilience is", "start": 721.12, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "before disaster.", "start": 723.36, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "The best time to finance transformation", "start": 725.279, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "is before crisis.", "start": 728.16, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "And the value of resilience should be", "start": 730.56, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "measured not only by what we build, but", "start": 733.36, "duration": 9.039}, {"text": "by what we prevent from being destroyed.", "start": 737.68, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "Mr. President Dominica does not come to", "start": 742.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "the United Nations asking to be treated", "start": 745.839, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "as a victim of vulnerability.", "start": 748.8, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "We come asking to be recognized as a", "start": 751.92, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "partner in transformation.", "start": 755.6, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "We must finance potential not merely", "start": 758.639, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "manage vulnerability.", "start": 762.56, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "And this is not only about Dominica.", "start": 765.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "It is about whether the global financial", "start": 769.6, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "system is capable of recognizing a", "start": 772.24, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "different development model. A model in", "start": 775.92, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "which resilience is an investment.", "start": 780.0, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "Nature is an asset. Connectivity is", "start": 783.6, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "productive infrastructure.", "start": 787.519, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "Clean energy is economic opportunity.", "start": 790.32, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "and prevention is financially smarter", "start": 794.48, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "than reconstruction.", "start": 797.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "That is the proposition we place before", "start": 800.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "this assembly. It is time that the", "start": 802.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "international financial architecture", "start": 805.839, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "evolves.", "start": 808.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Dominica joins its voice with those", "start": 810.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "countries that continue to advocate for", "start": 812.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "the use of multi-dimensional", "start": 816.399, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "vulnerability", "start": 818.8, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "as a practical and fair basis in", "start": 820.399, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "determining access to development", "start": 824.399, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "finance. We call for greater and easier", "start": 827.36, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "access to concessional financing and", "start": 831.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "grants for adaptation.", "start": 835.12, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "We call for stronger disaster clauses in", "start": 837.68, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "sovereign debt instruments. We call for", "start": 841.04, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "financing mechanisms that can be", "start": 844.48, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "activated rapidly when disasters strike.", "start": 847.279, "duration": 8.481}, {"text": "And we call for a fundamental shift in", "start": 851.6, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "the way the international community", "start": 855.76, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "views investment in resilience.", "start": 858.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Every dollar spent preventing the", "start": 863.279, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "destruction of a road, a hospital, a", "start": 865.44, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "school or a water system is an", "start": 868.56, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "investment in future development.", "start": 871.199, "duration": 8.721}, {"text": "Dominica is prepared to serve as a", "start": 875.519, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "demonstration country for this approach.", "start": 879.92, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "We are prepared to work with", "start": 884.399, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "international partners to show what", "start": 886.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "happens when finance is designed around", "start": 889.36, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "transformation", "start": 892.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "rather than vulnerability.", "start": 894.56, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "Mr. President, Dominica has long spoken", "start": 898.56, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "of becoming the world's first climate", "start": 902.639, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "resilient nation.", "start": 905.44, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "Today,", "start": 907.839, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "I wish to take that ambition further.", "start": 909.36, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "We invite the international community to", "start": 913.199, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "partner with us in making Dominica a", "start": 916.72, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "living laboratory for climate resilience", "start": 920.079, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "and sustainable development.", "start": 923.6, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Bring us the technology.", "start": 927.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Bring us the research.", "start": 930.32, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "Bring us the investment.", "start": 932.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Bring us the innovation.", "start": 935.199, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "And together,", "start": 938.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "let us demonstrate what a resilient", "start": 940.24, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "small island economy can look like.", "start": 943.36, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Resilient housing, smart and renewable", "start": 947.279, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "energy systems, climate smart", "start": 950.16, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "agriculture,", "start": 952.8, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "modern water management,", "start": 954.48, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "digital public services, resilient", "start": 957.04, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "infrastructure,", "start": 960.639, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "nature-based adaptation, and new", "start": 962.399, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "industries powered by clean energy.", "start": 965.759, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "This should not be a relationship based", "start": 970.399, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "simply on donor and recipient. It should", "start": 972.48, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "be a relationship based on partnership,", "start": 975.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "innovation, and shared learning.", "start": 978.399, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Dominica has lessons to learn from the", "start": 982.56, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "world, but we also have lessons to offer", "start": 985.279, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "the world.", "start": 990.399, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "Mr. President, transformation is", "start": 992.399, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "ultimately about people.", "start": 995.68, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "A resilient economy must create", "start": 998.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "opportunity for young people. Young", "start": 1000.959, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "people want to inherit a country that is", "start": 1003.839, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "not merely protected from disasters, but", "start": 1006.639, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "one in which they can build businesses,", "start": 1009.92, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "work in new industries, participate in", "start": 1013.04, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "the global economy, and build meaningful", "start": 1016.079, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "lives at home. That is why our", "start": 1019.279, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "investment in energy, connectivity,", "start": 1022.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "digital transformation,", "start": 1026.319, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "tourism, agriculture and resilience must", "start": 1028.48, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "ultimately converge around one", "start": 1033.6, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "objective,", "start": 1036.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "creating opportunity.", "start": 1038.079, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 1041.76, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "the challenges before us extend beyond", "start": 1043.28, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "climate and finance. We meet at a time", "start": 1046.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "when war continues to devastate", "start": 1050.0, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "communities and ruin lives. When", "start": 1052.72, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "humanitarian crisis are multiplying.", "start": 1056.08, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "When international law is under", "start": 1059.84, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "pressure. When trust between nations is", "start": 1062.24, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "strained. We cannot speak about", "start": 1066.24, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "development without speaking about", "start": 1069.2, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "peace. Without peace, development is", "start": 1071.84, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "tenuous.", "start": 1076.24, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "We believe in the principles of the", "start": 1078.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "United Nations Charter. We believe in", "start": 1080.24, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "respecting the sovereignty and", "start": 1083.52, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "territorial integrity of states. We", "start": 1085.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "believe in the peaceful settlement of", "start": 1088.48, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "international disputes. We believe in", "start": 1090.88, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "dialogue and we believe that", "start": 1093.919, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "international law must apply equally to", "start": 1097.039, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "all nations and must be applied", "start": 1100.72, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "consistently.", "start": 1104.32, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Small states must never become", "start": 1106.64, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "collateral damage in the competition", "start": 1108.88, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "among larger powers. The security of a", "start": 1111.679, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "small nation is no less important than", "start": 1115.6, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "the security of a large one. The", "start": 1118.96, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "credibility of multilateralism depends", "start": 1122.64, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "on fairness, but it also depends on", "start": 1125.36, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "delivery.", "start": 1128.72, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "The true test of multilateralism is not", "start": 1130.559, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "whether we can agree in this room.", "start": 1133.679, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "It is whether our agreements can", "start": 1137.84, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "transform lives outside of this room.", "start": 1140.88, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "That is why I welcome the central", "start": 1145.919, "duration": 8.401}, {"text": "challenge of this 81st general assembly.", "start": 1149.52, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Restoring trust.", "start": 1154.32, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 1156.88, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "the world does not need another", "start": 1158.48, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "generation of promises that remain", "start": 1160.4, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "unfulfilled.", "start": 1163.12, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "It needs delivery.", "start": 1164.96, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "It needs institutions that respond", "start": 1167.2, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "faster.", "start": 1170.08, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "It needs financing that reaches", "start": 1171.84, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "vulnerable countries more efficiently.", "start": 1174.32, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "It needs partnerships that produce", "start": 1177.76, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "measurable results. and it needs a", "start": 1180.64, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "multilateral system that people can", "start": 1183.6, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "believe in. Again,", "start": 1186.64, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "for Dominica, restoring trust means", "start": 1189.52, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "closing the gap between international", "start": 1192.64, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "commitments and the lived experience of", "start": 1195.039, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "our people. It means ensuring that when", "start": 1198.4, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the world says it supports climate", "start": 1201.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "resilience, resources actually reach the", "start": 1204.08, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "communities that need them. It means", "start": 1207.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "ensuring that when we call for", "start": 1211.12, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "sustainable development, financing", "start": 1213.12, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "mechanisms do not make sustainability", "start": 1216.08, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "harder to achieve. And it means", "start": 1219.84, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "recognizing that the challenges", "start": 1223.12, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "confronting small island states are not", "start": 1225.679, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "marginal issues.", "start": 1229.039, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "They are an early warning of the", "start": 1231.2, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "challenges that the wider world will", "start": 1234.159, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "increasingly face.", "start": 1237.28, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "The United Nations must remain a place", "start": 1239.679, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "where every country, large or small, can", "start": 1243.039, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "believe that its voice matters. But the", "start": 1246.64, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "United Nations must also remain a place", "start": 1249.76, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "where ambition can become action.", "start": 1252.799, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Mr. President, we must also confront the", "start": 1256.799, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "serious challenges facing the", "start": 1260.159, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "sustainable development goals. The SDGs", "start": 1262.799, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "represented a promise that by 2040 we", "start": 1266.799, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "would make meaningful progress in end in", "start": 1270.96, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "ending poverty and hunger, improving", "start": 1273.679, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "health and education, advancing", "start": 1276.799, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "equality, protecting our planet, and", "start": 1279.36, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "building more peaceful and inclusive", "start": 1282.72, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "societies.", "start": 1285.28, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Today, that promise is at risk.", "start": 1287.2, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "conflict, climate change, debt distress,", "start": 1291.76, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "inflation, and persistent inequality", "start": 1295.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "have pushed the goals further out of", "start": 1299.52, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "reach for many developing countries.", "start": 1301.76, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "But this is not the time to abandon the", "start": 1305.76, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "2030 agenda. It is the time to renew our", "start": 1308.88, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "commitment and concentrate on delivering", "start": 1312.88, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "results that people can see and feel in", "start": 1315.919, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "their daily lives. For Dominica, we have", "start": 1320.48, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "incorporated the SDGs as priorities in", "start": 1324.08, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "our national resilience development", "start": 1327.76, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "strategy 2030, our climate resilience", "start": 1330.48, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "and recovery plan and our wider", "start": 1333.84, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "development agenda. We see", "start": 1336.799, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "sustainability", "start": 1339.52, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and sustainable development in the homes", "start": 1341.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "we have built for vulnerable families in", "start": 1344.4, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "our investment in geothermal energy as", "start": 1347.36, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "cleaner, more affordable and reliable", "start": 1350.799, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "energy. We see it in our efforts to", "start": 1354.64, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "strengthen education, expand technical", "start": 1357.679, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "and vocational training, and better", "start": 1360.96, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "prepare our young people for the world", "start": 1363.84, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "of work. We see it in our support for", "start": 1366.559, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "farmers, entrepreneurs, agroprocessors,", "start": 1369.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "and tourism operators who are creating", "start": 1373.039, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "jobs and building stronger local", "start": 1376.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "industries.", "start": 1379.76, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "We also see it in our work to protect", "start": 1381.36, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "our forest, marine resources, and", "start": 1383.76, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "natural environment.", "start": 1386.559, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "For Dominica, these resources are part", "start": 1388.64, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "of our identity, but they are also", "start": 1391.36, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "essential to our food security, our", "start": 1394.48, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "tourism product, and the livelihoods of", "start": 1397.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "our people.", "start": 1400.4, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Excellencies, the challenges before us", "start": 1402.72, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "cannot be overcome by any one country", "start": 1405.84, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "acting alone. They require a strong and", "start": 1409.2, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "effective United Nations, renewed", "start": 1412.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "international cooperation and a firm", "start": 1415.52, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "commitment to multilateralism.", "start": 1418.64, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "We need a United Nations that does more", "start": 1421.52, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "than respond to crisis after lives have", "start": 1424.08, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "been lost and communities destroyed. We", "start": 1427.039, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "need an organization that works with", "start": 1430.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "determination to prevent conflict,", "start": 1432.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "advance sustainable development,", "start": 1435.2, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "confront justice, and protect those who", "start": 1437.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "are most vulnerable. We need a system in", "start": 1440.799, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "which every country, regardless of its", "start": 1444.24, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "size, wealth, or influence, has a voice", "start": 1447.2, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "and a meaningful place at the table.", "start": 1451.2, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "We need multilateralism", "start": 1454.72, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "that is not selective in its concern or", "start": 1457.039, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "even in its response but fair, effective", "start": 1461.2, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "and responsive to the needs of all", "start": 1465.679, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "people. Our development must include", "start": 1468.559, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "young people, women and girls,", "start": 1472.64, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "indigenous peoples, persons with", "start": 1476.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "disabilities, the elderly, and", "start": 1478.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "communities that have too often been", "start": 1481.84, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "left behind.", "start": 1484.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "If the United Nations is to deliver for", "start": 1486.64, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "all, it must first see,", "start": 1489.12, "duration": 8.559}, {"text": "hear, and include all.", "start": 1493.52, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Multilateralism is our best hope for", "start": 1497.679, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "addressing challenges that cross", "start": 1500.24, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "borders, threaten our shared future, and", "start": 1502.48, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "demand collective action. We therefore", "start": 1506.159, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "remain committed to peace, climate", "start": 1509.6, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "action, sustainable development, and the", "start": 1512.08, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "dignity of every human being. We remain", "start": 1515.52, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "ready to work with all nations in a", "start": 1520.159, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "spirit of mutual respect and shared", "start": 1523.679, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "responsibility", "start": 1526.799, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "to build a fairer, safer, and more", "start": 1528.4, "duration": 8.96}, {"text": "resilient world. Mr. President,", "start": 1532.08, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "let this 81st session be remembered as", "start": 1537.36, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "the moment when we collectively renewed", "start": 1541.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "our faith in cooperation", "start": 1544.88, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "and matched our words with action. Let", "start": 1547.36, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "this 81st session be remembered as the", "start": 1551.279, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "moment when vulnerability was met with", "start": 1554.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "solidarity,", "start": 1557.76, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "promises were honored, and trust was", "start": 1559.36, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "rebuilt through meaningful delivery.", "start": 1562.32, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Above all, let this 81st session be", "start": 1565.919, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "remembered as the moment when this", "start": 1569.52, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "family of nations found the courage to", "start": 1572.96, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "act together and recommitted ourselves", "start": 1576.559, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "to ensuring that no country, no", "start": 1580.64, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "community and no person was left behind.", "start": 1584.24, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "Iara, thank you. I thank you for the", "start": 1588.559, "duration": 7.561}, {"text": "courtesy of your attention.", "start": 1592.159, "duration": 3.961}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly,", "start": 1603.6, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "I wish to thank the President of the", "start": 1605.919, "duration": 6.681}, {"text": "Commonwealth of Dominica.", "start": 1608.4, "duration": 4.2}]